  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693422000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693430266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return an item. Order number is VF881-92B.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693436466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment while I pull that up for you... VF881-92B. I see the VeloFit ProForm cycling shoes. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693440133332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. I want to return them.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693448133332
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that. To get started, could you tell me what specifically is the issue with them? Is it a technical fault or a preference matter?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693450133332
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't fit. I wore them on one ride and they gave me blisters. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693460666665
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. Getting blisters is definitely not the experience we want for our riders. Let me just check the delivery date. It looks like you received these 13 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693466733331
    },
    {
      "text": "So? Can I return them or not?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693478933331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. Our policy allows for returns within 90 days, so you are well within the window. We can definitely process a full refund for those cycling shoes.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693481066664
    },
    {
      "text": "Good. What's the next step?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693492066664
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just sent a pre-paid return label to the email on file. Since you're a VIP member, I've of course waived any return fees. Just pack the shoes, with the cleats if you've attached them, back in the original box and affix the label.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693494066664
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. And the refund?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693509866664
    },
    {
      "text": "The moment our warehouse scans the return, the refund will be issued back to your original payment method. You should see it within 3 to 5 business days after that.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693511466664
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. Thanks.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693522599997
    },
    {
      "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can help you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693523666663
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 76881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764693528533329
    },
    {
